    "I'd love to hear your honest thoughts! Whether it's a feature idea, a bug, or just telling me what's working (and what isn't)—your feedback helps me improve. Please write to me at:" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "I'd love to hear your honest thoughts! Whether it's a feature idea, a bug, or just telling me what's working (and what isn't)—your feedback helps me improve. Please write to me at:"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "我很想听听你的真实想法！无论是功能建议、问题反馈，还是告诉我哪些地方好用（或不好用）——你的反馈都能帮我做得更好。请致信："
          }
        }
      }
